#: R/texts.R
msgid "Closeness and betweenness (optional): based on the shortest paths between items. They are less stable and harder to interpret in psychological networks (Bringmann et al., 2019; see references)."
msgstr "Cercanía e intermediación (opcionales): se basan en los caminos más cortos entre ítems. Son menos estables y más difíciles de interpretar en redes psicológicas (Bringmann et al., 2019; ver referencias)."

#: R/texts.R
msgid "Closeness and betweenness are shown because they were requested. In psychological networks they are often unstable and have no clear meaning (Bringmann et al., 2019); give them less weight than strength."
msgstr "La cercanía y la intermediación se muestran porque se pidieron. En redes psicológicas suelen ser inestables y no tienen un significado claro (Bringmann et al., 2019); deles menos peso que a la fuerza."

